Shutdown 
Shuts down, restarts, or logs off a computer. Syntax shutdown 

[parameters] 
Params 
/s Shut down 
/r Restart 
/l Log off
/t  s> <seconds> Delay before action
/a Abort shutdown

shutdown /r /t 60     # Restart after 60 seconds

